<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/inventions?focus=rifling">Inventions &amp; Discoveries</a> · Weapons and war</p><h1 class="enc-title">Rifling</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1520">1520</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Rifling is the helical grooving cut inside a gun barrel to spin the projectile, steadying its flight and making it more accurate. Its inventor is not known: straight 'soot grooves' were cut in small arms from at least 1480, and among the earliest recorded spiral-grooved barrels are those of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vienna">Vienna</a> gunsmith Gaspard Kollner in 1498 and of Augustus Kotter of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nuremberg">Nuremberg</a> in 1520. Because the grooves had to be engraved by hand, rifled guns were at first used mostly by wealthy hunters, and they became common only in the mid-19th century; the first practical military rifled weapons were breech-loaders such as the Queen Anne pistol.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rifling.jpg" alt="Rifling" width="330" height="330" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: baku13 · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:105mm_tank_gun_Rifling.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="inv-entry"><h2 class="enc-section-title">On the inventions tree</h2><dl class="inv-entry-facts"><div><dt>First known</dt><dd>1520</dd></div><div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Nuremberg</dd></div><div><dt>Credited to</dt><dd>Augustus Kotter · Gaspard Kollner</dd></div></dl><p class="inv-entry-note"><span class="inv-k">Note</span>Gaspard Kollner of Vienna made spiral-grooved barrels as early as 1498 by some accounts, but some scholars hold that his grooves were straight until Kotter helped him.</p><div class="inv-entry-rel"><span class="inv-k">Built on</span><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/arquebus">Arquebus<span>1411</span></a></div><p class="enc-article-foot"><a class="enc-random-link" href="/inventions?focus=rifling">See it on the inventions tree &rarr;</a></p></section>
